{"obsah":"<p>The second-to-last Saturday of the summer holidays brought us a small three-course series. We visited a fairly big corporate event in northern Bohemia with Martin Šimůnek, Vlasta Kabeláč Čiháček and Matouš Balík. Vlasta and Matouš then headed to a real village event in Mečeříž, where the local crowd was waiting for them at the 'Farewell to the Holidays' event. Martin Šimůnek continued on a solo ride in Králův Dvůr, where he let himself be egged on into jumping off a shipping container converted into toilets :)</p>\n\n<p>In the morning it looked like a rainy day, but in the end the weather was 100% perfect – which can't be said of the following few days. </p>\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-gallery has-nested-images columns-default is-cropped\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><a href=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2023%2F08%2F369934788_960635405026312_9126777910640858378_n.webp?alt=media\"><img src=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2023%2F08%2F369934788_960635405026312_9126777910640858378_n.webp?alt=media\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-238099\"/></a></figure>\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><a href=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2023%2F08%2F369947367_960635348359651_1840562232450583162_n.webp?alt=media\"><img src=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2023%2F08%2F369947367_960635348359651_1840562232450583162_n.webp?alt=media\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-238100\"/></a></figure>\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><a href=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2023%2F08%2F370250828_960635065026346_4059036729508799763_n.webp?alt=media\"><img src=\"https://firebasestorage.googl